# COSMObase pure-solvent panel — process / crystallization screen (user panel).
# One solvent per line; names = COSMObase basenames (without the _c0.cosmo suffix).
# Comment lines start with '#'; blank lines ignored.
# Level-aware: resolved against BP-TZVP-COSMO (lysozyme) or BP-TZVPD-FINE (others).
#
# Names verified against COSMObase (BP-TZVP-COSMO + BP-TZVPD-FINE).
# Dropped: phosphate buffer pH7 (PBS) — COSMO-RS cannot represent salts / pH;
#   2-methyltetrahydrofuran and isobutylacetate — not found in either database
#   (nor in the reference panel). Give a basename to re-add either.

# --- Water (1) ---
h2o

# --- Alcohols (7) ---
methanol
ethanol
propanol                  # 1-propanol
2-propanol                # IPA
1-butanol
2-butanol                 # ** NEW **
1-pentanol                # ** NEW **

# --- Ketones (3) ---
propanone                 # acetone
butanone                  # 2-butanone / MEK
4-methyl-2-pentanone      # MIBK   ** NEW **

# --- Nitrile (1) ---
acetonitrile

# --- Ethers / cyclic (4) ---
thf
dioxane                   # 1,4-dioxane
cyclopentyl-methyl-ether  # CPME (per reference)
anisole

# --- Esters (4) ---
ethylacetate
isopropylacetate
n-propylacetate
n-butylacetate            # butyl acetate (per reference)

# --- Hydrocarbons / aromatic (4) ---
n-heptane                 # heptane
methylcyclohexane         # ** NEW **
toluene
1,3-dimethylbenzene       # xylene (m-isomer, per reference)
